rk out but we'll  see i'll be keeping an eye on it it'll  be an interesting development because if  it does work then we've got a new outlet  that will possibly eventually get us  some good or even great video game  adaptations on the other hand if this  thing happens and it stinks well that's  sort of one more closed door what are  your thoughts on this aside from Zelda  what is a game that you think would make  a great Netflix tile TV series speaking  personally I think this format would  really work for god of war but what do  you think whatever it is drop something  down in the comments and let's talk  about it until next time this council is  adjourned  you
 

